{"problem":{"stackLimit":128,"modifiedUser":"FrankieFly","judgeCaseMode":"default","auth":1,"description":"小镇上有一个神奇的商店，里面摆满了各种奇异的宝石。宝石们形状各异、颜色绚丽，每一颗都有自己独特的能量。小镇上的居民们非常喜爱这些宝石，经常来商店挑选和购买。一天，店主 $CleverOnion$ 决定举办一场有趣的挑战：他会将一些宝石的能量数值写在一张纸上，并要求挑战者找出其中最小和最大的能量数值。\n\n店主的挑战吸引了不少人来参与，因为传说中成功找出这些宝石能量的极值能获得一颗充满祝福的稀有宝石。现在，轮到你来接受挑战了。你需要根据店主提供的数值，找出这些宝石的最小和最大能量数值，并告诉店主。","source":"原创","title":"能量宝石","type":0,"output":"输出两个整数，表示宝石能量数值的最小值和最大值。","ioScore":100,"codeShare":true,"isFileIO":false,"isRemote":false,"timeLimit":1000,"difficulty":0,"input":"首先输入一个整数 n，表示宝石能量数值的个数（1 ≤ n ≤ 1000）。\n接着输入 n 个整数  $a_1, a_2, ..., a_n$（-1000 ≤ $a_i$ ≤ 1000），表示每颗宝石的能量数值，可以有重复。","examples":"<input>5\n3 9 1 5 8</input><output>1\n9</output>","hint":"","isRemoveEndBlank":true,"openCaseResult":true,"memoryLimit":256,"problemId":"Q0006","isGroup":false,"isUploadCase":true,"judgeMode":"default"},"languages":["C","C++","Java","Python3"],"samples":[{"output":"q00061.out","input":"q00061.in","score":6},{"output":"q00062.out","input":"q00062.in","score":6},{"output":"q00063.out","input":"q00063.in","score":6},{"output":"q00064.out","input":"q00064.in","score":6},{"output":"q00065.out","input":"q00065.in","score":6},{"output":"q00066.out","input":"q00066.in","score":7},{"output":"q00067.out","input":"q00067.in","score":7},{"output":"q00068.out","input":"q00068.in","score":7},{"output":"q00069.out","input":"q00069.in","score":7},{"output":"q000610.out","input":"q000610.in","score":7},{"output":"q000611.out","input":"q000611.in","score":7},{"output":"q000612.out","input":"q000612.in","score":7},{"output":"q000613.out","input":"q000613.in","score":7},{"output":"q000614.out","input":"q000614.in","score":7},{"output":"q000615.out","input":"q000615.in","score":7}],"tags":["数组","排序"],"codeTemplates":[],"judgeMode":"default"}